WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.459 --> 00:00:03.294
A train's here.

00:00:03.294 --> 00:00:05.171
I'm so excited to 
meet your niece.

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:06.172
Coo!

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.048
Welcome!

00:00:07.382 --> 00:00:09.384
I'm so pleased to see 
you uncle Stillwater.

00:00:09.926 --> 00:00:11.469
May I introduce my friends?

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.596
Addy, Michael and Karl.

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:17.642
It's beautiful here.

00:00:21.604 --> 00:00:23.481
Isn't it interesting how different

00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:25.692
shapes and textures 
create harmony.

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.905
I've been working really hard
on this show all week.

00:00:30.905 --> 00:00:32.365
You glued on googly eyes?

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:33.450
Uggh!

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.786
Would you like to hear a story?

00:00:38.621 --> 00:00:41.416
Sometimes others can
add something extra.

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:42.167
I think I get it now.

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:46.546
Woo Hoo!

00:00:47.797 --> 00:00:49.799
It all began with a sea monster!

00:00:50.008 --> 00:00:51.676
This show's very special.

00:00:51.676 --> 00:00:53.303
Most special indeed.

